---
source: cli/src/agents_cmd_tests.rs
expression: help
---
Browse agent sessions or focus an attached TUI

Usage: agents [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --json
          Print a complete agents dashboard snapshot as one JSONL line

      --watch
          Keep emitting snapshots as the dashboard changes (requires --json)

      --focus <SESSION_ID>
          Focus an existing local TUI displaying this session, without opening one

      --local <ADDR>
          Connect the TUI to a shared local app server endpoint.

          Accepted forms: `ws://host:port`, `wss://host:port`, `unix://`, or `unix://PATH`.

      --remote <ADDR>
          Connect the TUI to a remote app server endpoint.

          Accepted forms: `ws://host:port`, `wss://host:port`, `unix://`, or `unix://PATH`.

      --remote-auth-token-env <ENV_VAR>
          Name of the environment variable containing the bearer token to send to a remote app
          server websocket

  -C, --cd <DIR>
          Use this directory for new tasks on a remote server

      --no-alt-screen
          Disable alternate screen mode

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
